{"4259720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BECOME LIFE", "steam_appid": 4259720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A SINGLE PLAYER NARRATIVE SURVIVAL EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world didn’t end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It disappeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I remember the constant sound of machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold lights above my head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A voice calling my name, trying to keep me awake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last thing I remember is the world as it was back then.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When I open my eyes again, something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No continuity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hospital is empty rooms abandoned, as if time itself had stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside, the world I knew no longer exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years have passed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten, maybe more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no calendar truly confirms it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gargano has changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real places once familiar, now feel suspended, trapped in an endless wait:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monte Sant’Angelo. Foresta Umbra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >San Severo, Apricena, Foggia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peschici, Vico del Gargano…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Places I recognize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Places that no longer recognize me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And above all, I search for those who should never have disappeared..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/c53230ca8846a1a52a8596d054c31a87.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/c53230ca8846a1a52a8596d054c31a87.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/c53230ca8846a1a52a8596d054c31a87.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a grounded, atmospheric world inspired by real locations from the Gargano region in Italy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/a611dcf78ee769f82dc5cac66e4ab1ec.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/a611dcf78ee769f82dc5cac66e4ab1ec.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/a611dcf78ee769f82dc5cac66e4ab1ec.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive by managing basic needs such as hunger, thirst, and exposure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and changing environmental conditions that affect movement, risk, and decision-making.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/2d8dc31ef5baebe3132007b40f6e8f40.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/2d8dc31ef5baebe3132007b40f6e8f40.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/2d8dc31ef5baebe3132007b40f6e8f40.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A persistent world: forced doors remain forced, collected items do not respawn, and your actions leave lasting marks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/de4beba1e4ef4797d28f7c862283d96a.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/de4beba1e4ef4797d28f7c862283d96a.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/de4beba1e4ef4797d28f7c862283d96a.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth-driven tension where sound matters—footsteps and noise can attract danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge, craft, and adapt using limited resources as you push deeper into the unknown.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/9a96e69f9221b95d0afb3a229f47ff16.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/9a96e69f9221b95d0afb3a229f47ff16.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/9a96e69f9221b95d0afb3a229f47ff16.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in close-range encounters using your fists or a variety of weapons discovered throughout the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approach situations through stealth, observation, or direct confrontation, depending on your choices and available resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience slower, investigative moments alongside more intense and dangerous sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic encounters that may include contextual actions and timed sequences during key moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and use vehicles to traverse the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/984a4e956e46730fe561e245617d6f58.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/984a4e956e46730fe561e245617d6f58.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/984a4e956e46730fe561e245617d6f58.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/8b4261abe02375265ce0f66f3bf44830.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/8b4261abe02375265ce0f66f3bf44830.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/8b4261abe02375265ce0f66f3bf44830.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/8e36f5a38851918d2c65e90921e00974.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/8e36f5a38851918d2c65e90921e00974.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/8e36f5a38851918d2c65e90921e00974.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with wildlife and hostile creatures that inhabit the environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/130ae907511d2bd418ef382e8e6d9e87.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/130ae907511d2bd418ef382e8e6d9e87.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/130ae907511d2bd418ef382e8e6d9e87.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/248ee648b98ac602555ce26c8343ee8b.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/248ee648b98ac602555ce26c8343ee8b.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/248ee648b98ac602555ce26c8343ee8b.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/d7a7d1ecb8f956d2251d9b7782fd9e5b.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/d7a7d1ecb8f956d2251d9b7782fd9e5b.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/d7a7d1ecb8f956d2251d9b7782fd9e5b.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and equip clothing to adapt to environmental conditions and survival needs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/a32ed52a8e1cec6d4eba3afab28fe823.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/a32ed52a8e1cec6d4eba3afab28fe823.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/a32ed52a8e1cec6d4eba3afab28fe823.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player narrative campaign featuring cinematic sequences, a story with a clear beginning and end, and optional side activities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory and equipment management designed to support long-term survival and adaptation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some obstacles can be overcome through force, tools, or alternative routes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A WORD FROM THE CREATOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BECOME LIFE is an independent project developed with a long-term vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ve been developing it solo since May 2023, without a budget, while balancing work and everyday life and becoming a father along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ve always wanted to create videogames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not to prove something, but to tell a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is one of many stories I’ve written, but it’s the one I could no longer keep on paper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It needed to become a place something to walk through, something to live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I don’t promise perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I promise dedication, listening, and constant improvement throughout development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for being here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*This is a work of fiction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While inspired by real places, all characters, events, and narrative elements are entirely fictional.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Any resemblance to actual persons, living or dead, is purely coincidental.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A SINGLE PLAYER NARRATIVE SURVIVAL EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world didn’t end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It disappeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I remember the constant sound of machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cold lights above my head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A voice calling my name, trying to keep me awake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was 2025.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The last thing I remember is the world as it was back then.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When I open my eyes again, something is wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No movement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No continuity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hospital is empty rooms abandoned, as if time itself had stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outside, the world I knew no longer exists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years have passed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ten, maybe more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no calendar truly confirms it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Gargano has changed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real places once familiar, now feel suspended, trapped in an endless wait:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monte Sant’Angelo. Foresta Umbra.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >San Severo, Apricena, Foggia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peschici, Vico del Gargano…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Places I recognize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Places that no longer recognize me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And above all, I search for those who should never have disappeared..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/c53230ca8846a1a52a8596d054c31a87.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/c53230ca8846a1a52a8596d054c31a87.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/c53230ca8846a1a52a8596d054c31a87.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a grounded, atmospheric world inspired by real locations from the Gargano region in Italy.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/a611dcf78ee769f82dc5cac66e4ab1ec.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/a611dcf78ee769f82dc5cac66e4ab1ec.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/a611dcf78ee769f82dc5cac66e4ab1ec.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive by managing basic needs such as hunger, thirst, and exposure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather and changing environmental conditions that affect movement, risk, and decision-making.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/2d8dc31ef5baebe3132007b40f6e8f40.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/2d8dc31ef5baebe3132007b40f6e8f40.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/2d8dc31ef5baebe3132007b40f6e8f40.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A persistent world: forced doors remain forced, collected items do not respawn, and your actions leave lasting marks.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/de4beba1e4ef4797d28f7c862283d96a.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/de4beba1e4ef4797d28f7c862283d96a.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/de4beba1e4ef4797d28f7c862283d96a.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stealth-driven tension where sound matters—footsteps and noise can attract danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge, craft, and adapt using limited resources as you push deeper into the unknown.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/9a96e69f9221b95d0afb3a229f47ff16.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/9a96e69f9221b95d0afb3a229f47ff16.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/9a96e69f9221b95d0afb3a229f47ff16.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in close-range encounters using your fists or a variety of weapons discovered throughout the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approach situations through stealth, observation, or direct confrontation, depending on your choices and available resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience slower, investigative moments alongside more intense and dangerous sequences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematic encounters that may include contextual actions and timed sequences during key moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and use vehicles to traverse the world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/984a4e956e46730fe561e245617d6f58.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/984a4e956e46730fe561e245617d6f58.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/984a4e956e46730fe561e245617d6f58.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/8b4261abe02375265ce0f66f3bf44830.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/8b4261abe02375265ce0f66f3bf44830.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/8b4261abe02375265ce0f66f3bf44830.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/8e36f5a38851918d2c65e90921e00974.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/8e36f5a38851918d2c65e90921e00974.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/8e36f5a38851918d2c65e90921e00974.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with wildlife and hostile creatures that inhabit the environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/130ae907511d2bd418ef382e8e6d9e87.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/130ae907511d2bd418ef382e8e6d9e87.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/130ae907511d2bd418ef382e8e6d9e87.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/248ee648b98ac602555ce26c8343ee8b.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/248ee648b98ac602555ce26c8343ee8b.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/248ee648b98ac602555ce26c8343ee8b.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/d7a7d1ecb8f956d2251d9b7782fd9e5b.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/d7a7d1ecb8f956d2251d9b7782fd9e5b.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/d7a7d1ecb8f956d2251d9b7782fd9e5b.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize and equip clothing to adapt to environmental conditions and survival needs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/a32ed52a8e1cec6d4eba3afab28fe823.poster.avif?t=1766183210\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/a32ed52a8e1cec6d4eba3afab28fe823.webm?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/extras/a32ed52a8e1cec6d4eba3afab28fe823.mp4?t=1766183210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player narrative campaign featuring cinematic sequences, a story with a clear beginning and end, and optional side activities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory and equipment management designed to support long-term survival and adaptation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some obstacles can be overcome through force, tools, or alternative routes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A WORD FROM THE CREATOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BECOME LIFE is an independent project developed with a long-term vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ve been developing it solo since May 2023, without a budget, while balancing work and everyday life and becoming a father along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’ve always wanted to create videogames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not to prove something, but to tell a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is one of many stories I’ve written, but it’s the one I could no longer keep on paper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It needed to become a place something to walk through, something to live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I don’t promise perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I promise dedication, listening, and constant improvement throughout development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for being here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>*This is a work of fiction.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>While inspired by real places, all characters, events, and narrative elements are entirely fictional.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Any resemblance to actual persons, living or dead, is purely coincidental.</strong></p>", "short_description": "A single-player narrative survival experience set in the abandoned landscapes of Gargano, Italy. Explore, endure, and uncover what happened after the disappearance where every choice leaves a mark.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4259720/59ec58a563ee5ccf1bb8b4726ff9efc18e723551/header.jpg?t=1766183210", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste